  "body": "CI on `ae0d06c`: all 22 test jobs in `gate` passed (gate, gate-ops, gate-packet-loop, gate-registry, all 8 `gate-cong-cu` shards and 8 `gate-nhanh-manh` shards, gate-nhanh-gop). The only failure is the aggregation job `gate-cong-cu-gop (ubuntu-latest)`. It failed twice the same way: it never got a runner (`runner_id: 0`, no steps, finished 2 s after creation). Attempt 1 was job `122349150091` and attempt 2 job `122349565980`, after one `rerun_failed_jobs`. There is no log (404), so this can't be traced to the code.\n\nMy one re-run is used up. The next push to this branch, which will carry the git-lookup architecture change following review r2 round 2, will start a fresh CI run. I'm continuing to watch the PR.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
